  "title": "Bread Pudding with Lemon Sauce I",
  "description": "The best remedy for stale bread is to tear it into pieces and bake it in milk, eggs, sugar and spices. Call it bread pudding and devour it still warm with a luscious lemon sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Linda"
  ],
